    "Run the 21 predicate cases in three query batches, one for each secondary_concurrency value. Compare all keys, fields, missing/null distinction, result order and atom/molecule identity presence.",
    "Read the initial protein in one query batch. Send the source key change as one mutation batch. Read current source, current peer, old peer and unrelated record by batch.",
    "Send the reverse peer update as one mutation batch. Read all five current/old/unrelated locations by batch and retain UUIDs.",
    "Use normal flush, then normal node stop and reopen of the same owned synthetic home.",
    "Run the selected four predicate cases with each concurrency value. Re-read the five protein locations in one batch and compare values and UUIDs.",
    "Preserve raw requests, responses, source/binary/helper identities, normal stops, summary and ownership marker. Seal and prepare exact cleanup preview. Do not reclaim before root review."
